# Badlands and Desolace, Alliance ~39 to ~40.5 (consensus visits 28-32).
# Flow: Loch Modan > the Badlands (Hammertoe's Digsite, the Valley of Fangs,
# Agmond's End, Lotwil's elementals in the Dustbowl, the Ancient Chest) >
# hearth to Thelsamar > fly to Menethil, boat to Theramore (flight path,
# two turn-ins) > fly to Nijel's Point > Desolace (Ethel Rethor first, then
# one loop south through the Kodo Graveyard, Gelkis Village, the Mannoroc
# Coven and the Magram, back up the road to Nijel's Point) > fly to Theramore,
# where the next guide starts.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - The Shimmering Flats and Ratchet stops (visits 30-31) are dropped: a long
#   ride from Dustwallow for small breadcrumbs (News for Fizzle 1137,
#   Wharfmaster Dizzywig 1111, Goblin Sponsorship 1178/1180, Parts for Kravel
#   1112), about 4,000 XP. News for Fizzle is not taken from Martek.
# - Dustwallow Marsh's two visits are merged into one loop at the start of the
#   next guide; this guide only passes Theramore for the flight path and the
#   two turn-ins by the flight master. Lieutenant Paval Reethe's badge (1252)
#   lies at the Shady Rest Inn, on that loop.
# - Badlands Reagent Run (2500) is handed in to Ghak Healtouch right after the
#   hearth to Thelsamar instead of at 47.9: same spot, full XP.
# - Theramore and Ratchet binds are dropped (replaced before any hearth);
#   the bind is Nijel's Point.
# - Desolace: the Karnitol's Satchel step (1456, then 1457 to Ironforge) needs
#   a second trip to the far north-west coast after Kreldig: left out.
#   Claim Rackmore's Treasure! (6161) is left out: its two keys drop at
#   opposite ends of the west coast. Gizelton Caravan and Get Me Out of Here!
#   are escorts, handled as a goto with a note.
# - Stone Is Better than Cloth (716) and Jarl Needs a Blade (1203, next guide)
#   want crafted items (Patterned Bronze Bracers, a Moonsteel Broadsword): optional.
# Left out: A Sign of Hope (721, to Hammertoe Grez inside Uldaman) and Pearl
# Diving (705, its clams lie on Stranglethorn's far north-west coast, which the
# route no longer visits): never finished on the route.
# Class training: none here; the next guide trains in Stormwind.
guide forever/alliance/30-40/07-badlands
title Badlands & Desolace
faction Alliance
levels 39-41
zone Badlands
next forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Hammertoe's Digsite

step Hammertoe's Digsite
  zone Badlands
  tip Ride back west to the road and follow it south out of Loch Modan through the pass into the Badlands. Prospector Ryedol and Sigrun Ironhew camp side by side at the dig.
  accept 719                          -- Prospector Ryedol
  accept 718                          -- Sigrun Ironhew

step Shadowforge camp
  tip The Shadowforge dwarves camp just north of the digsite; the crumpled map lies among their tents. Tunnelers and Darkweavers carry Ryedol's pick. Crag Coyotes roam the slopes around it.
  accept 720                          -- Crumpled Map
  collect 4616 quest 719              -- Ryedol's Lucky Pick
  collect 7846 quest 2500             -- Crag Coyote Fang

step The excavation crate
  tip Ride north-east to the abandoned dig; the supply crate lies there among the Dustbelcher ogres.
  collect 4629 quest 718              -- Supply Crate

step Hammertoe's Digsite
  turnin 719                          -- Prospector Ryedol
  turnin 720
  note Ryedol's next errand goes into Uldaman: skip it.
  turnin 718                          -- Sigrun Ironhew
  accept 733

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The middle

step Valley of Fangs
  tip Martek and Rigglefuzz camp together in the Valley of Fangs, in the middle of the Badlands.
  turnin 1106                         -- Martek the Exiled
  accept 1108
  accept 703                          -- Rigglefuzz

step Ogres and buzzards
  tip The Dustbelcher ogres camp just south of the valley; any of them drops scrap. Buzzards circle the plain to the east.
  collect 4630 quest 733              -- Scrap Metal
  collect 3404 quest 703              -- Buzzard Wing
  collect 7847 quest 2500             -- Buzzard Gizzard

step Agmond's End
  tip The battered skeleton lies just east of the ogres, at the edge of the Stonevault trogg camp; the Bonesnappers and Shamans around it drop the flakes. Theldurin sits by the ruined camp further south.
  turnin 738                          -- Battered Dwarven Skeleton
  note The skeleton's next task, Murdaloc, waits until the later Badlands guide at 43.
  collect 5797 quest 1108             -- Indurium Flake
  accept 709                          -- Theldurin the Lost

step Valley of Fangs
  turnin 703                          -- Rigglefuzz
  turnin 1108                         -- Martek the Exiled
  note Martek's next errand goes to the Shimmering Flats: skip it.

step Lotwil Veriatus
  tip Ride west into the Dustbowl; Lotwil works by his machines in the middle of it.
  accept 710

step Lesser Rock Elementals
  tip The Lesser Rock Elementals wander the Dustbowl west of Lotwil.
  collect 4626 quest 710              -- Small Stone Shard
  collect 7848 quest 2500             -- Rock Elemental Shard

step Lotwil Veriatus
  turnin 710
  accept 711

step Rock Elementals
  tip The Rock Elementals roam south-east of Lotwil; Giant Buzzards and Elder Crag Coyotes share the plain to their west.
  collect 4627 quest 711              -- Large Stone Slab
  collect 7848 quest 2500             -- Rock Elemental Shard
  collect 7847 quest 2500             -- Buzzard Gizzard
  collect 7846 quest 2500             -- Crag Coyote Fang

step Lotwil Veriatus
  turnin 711
  accept 712

step Greater Rock Elementals
  tip The Greater Rock Elementals (level 42) walk the far south-west corner below Camp Boff; pull them one at a time. The Dustbelcher Wyrmhunters and Maulers at Camp Boff also drop scrap.
  collect 4628 quest 712              -- Bracers of Rock Binding
  collect 4630 quest 733              -- Scrap Metal

step Lotwil Veriatus
  turnin 712
  accept 716 optional                 -- Lucien Tosselwrench, beside Lotwil
  turnin 716 optional                 -- only if you carry Patterned Bronze Bracers (a blacksmith's craft)
  note Lotwil's next test needs crafted gear: skip it.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The north

step The Ancient Chest
  tip Ride north-east to the dwarven ruins in the north of the Badlands; the chest sits among the Shadowforge dwarves. Ambassador Infernus nearby is elite: give him room.
  collect 4631 quest 709              -- Tablet of Ryun'eh

step Hammertoe's Digsite
  turnin 733                          -- Sigrun Ironhew

step Theldurin the Lost
  tip Ride south to Agmond's End.
  turnin 709
  accept 727                          -- for Gerrig Bonegrip in Ironforge: keep it

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To Theramore

step Thelsamar
  zone Loch Modan
  hearth "Stoutlager Inn"
  turnin 2500                         -- Ghak Healtouch, in the inn

step Menethil Harbor
  zone Wetlands
  fly "Menethil Harbor"
  tip Take the boat to Theramore from the far pier.
  goto 4.7,63.8 "Boat to Theramore"

step Theramore
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip The flight master stands by the gate of Foothold Citadel; Clerk Lendry and Commander Samaul are inside the citadel.
  getfp "Theramore"
  turnin 1302                         -- Clerk Lendry
  turnin 1264                         -- Commander Samaul
  accept 1265                         -- for the Dustwallow loop in the next guide

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Desolace: the west

step Nijel's Point
  zone Desolace
  fly "Nijel's Point"
  sethome "Nijel's Point"
  turnin 6141                         -- Brother Anton
  accept 261
  accept 1454                         -- Kreldig Ungor
  accept 1466

step Karnitol's Chest
  tip Follow the road west across the north of Desolace to the ruins of Ethel Rethor; the wrecked ship's chest lies on the shore just west of them.
  turnin 1454                         -- Karnitol's Chest
  accept 1455

step Azore Aldamort
  tip Azore's tower stands on the hill east of the wreck.
  accept 6027

step Lord Kragaru
  tip Lord Kragaru, a centaur chieftain, camps on the north-west coast, north of Azore's tower.
  collect 15803 quest 6027            -- Book of the Ancients

step Azore Aldamort
  turnin 6027

step Nijel's Point
  hearth "Nijel's Point"
  turnin 1455                         -- Kreldig Ungor
  note Kreldig's next task, Karnitol's Satchel, is a drop on the far coast: skip it.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Desolace: the south loop

step Bibbly F'utzbuckle
  tip Follow the road south to Kormek's Hut.
  accept 5501

step Kodo Graveyard
  tip Hornizz stands at the edge of the Kodo Graveyard, south-west of Kormek's Hut; Kodo Bones lie among the skeletons.
  accept 6134                         -- Hornizz Brimbuzzle
  collect 13703 quest 5501            -- Kodo Bone

step Melizza Brimbuzzle
  tip Melizza is held in the centaur camp west of the graveyard. Free her and keep her alive on the walk out; she stops by the graveyard.
  accept 6132
  complete 6132 @40.1,61.6            -- escort Melizza back toward the graveyard

step Hornizz Brimbuzzle
  turnin 6132

step Gelkis Village
  tip Uthek the Wise sits in the Gelkis centaur village in the south-west.
  turnin 1373                         -- Uthek the Wise
  accept 1374

step Gizelton Caravan
  tip Rigger Gizelton's caravan stops on the road east of Gelkis Village. Take the quest and walk with the kodos past the Mannoroc Coven, killing the demons that jump them; talk to Smeed at his camp east of the Kodo Graveyard afterwards.
  accept 5943                         -- Rigger Gizelton
  complete 5943 @55.7,67.8
  turnin 5943                         -- Smeed Scrabblescrew

step Mannoroc Coven
  tip The demons gather at the Mannoroc Coven in southern Desolace: felhounds (Mana Eaters, Mage and Ley Hunters), Nether Maidens and Sisters, and Doomwarder Captains around the pit.
  collect 6250 quest 1466             -- Felhound Brain
  collect 6251 quest 1466             -- Nether Wing
  collect 6252 quest 1466             -- Doomwarder Blood

step The Magram and the Valley of Bones
  tip Khan Jehn leads the Magram in their village east of the Coven. Undead Ravagers roam the bone fields south of it; at the far south-east, use the Crate of Ghost Magnets to draw the Magrami Spectres.
  collect 6072 quest 1374             -- Khan Jehn's Head
  kill 11561 quest 261                -- Undead Ravager
  collect 15849 quest 6134            -- Ghost-o-plasm

step Gelkis Village
  tip Ride west along the south of Desolace.
  turnin 1374                         -- Uthek the Wise

step Kodo Graveyard
  turnin 6134                         -- Hornizz Brimbuzzle

step Kormek's Hut
  turnin 5501                         -- Bibbly F'utzbuckle

step Nijel's Point
  tip Follow the road north to Nijel's Point.
  turnin 1466                         -- Kreldig Ungor
  accept 1467                         -- for Roetten Stonehammer in Ironforge: keep it
  turnin 261                          -- Brother Anton
  accept 1052                         -- for Raleigh the Devout in Southshore: keep it

step Fly to Theramore
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip The next guide starts in Theramore.
  fly "Theramore"
